days.exerciseText:
// Keep your chest up and core braced throughout
Goblet Squat / 1x7-12, 2x11-12 / 14kg 60s / progress: dp(2kg, 10, 12)

// Hinge at the hips, soft bend in knees, keep back flat
Romanian Deadlift / 3x11-12 / 22kg 60s / progress: dp(2kg, 10, 12)

// Step forward, keep front knee over ankle
Lunge, Dumbbell / 2x10 11kg, 1x10 10kg / 60s / progress: dp(2kg, 10, 12)

// Use a band anchored at head height, pull to your nose
Face Pull / 1x20-20, 1x19-20, 1x20-20 / 10kg 45s / warmup: none / progress: dp(2kg, 15, 20)

// Hold a strong straight line, don't let your hips drop
Plank / 3x30 / 45s / warmup: none

// Lower slowly, elbows at 45 degrees from your body
Incline Chest Press, Band / 3x10-12 / 10kg 60s / progress: dp(2kg, 10, 12)

// Pull shoulder blades together at the top
Reverse Fly / 3x12-15 / 11kg 45s / warmup: none / progress: dp(2kg, 12, 15)

// Brace your core, press straight up overhead
Overhead Press, Dumbbell / 2x11-12, 1x10-12 / 8kg 60s / progress: dp(2kg, 10, 12)

// Use a band anchored at head height, pull to your nose
Face Pull / 1x20-20, 1x19-20, 1x20-20 / 10kg 45s

// Slow and controlled, elbow to opposite knee
Bicycle Crunch / 3x20 / 45s / warmup: none
